# DEV WORKFLOW — ИНДЕКС

Папка: `.cursor/rules/back_developer/`  
**Роутер:** @.cursor/rules/mainrule.mdc  
**Core:** @.cursor/rules/back_developer/mainrule-core.mdc  
**Процесс:** `workflow-*.mdc` → gates `isolation_rules/_lean/<mode>.mdc`. Скиллы — только из workflow.

## Happy path

| Режим | Процесс |
|-------|---------|
| `BACK VAN` | @.cursor/rules/back_developer/workflow-van.mdc |
| `BACK PLAN` | @.cursor/rules/back_developer/workflow-plan.mdc — Phase 0 auto-clarify + Phase 1 (+ inline roadmap-merge) |
| `BACK CLARIFY` | @.cursor/rules/back_developer/workflow-clarify.mdc — добор / revisit / standalone |
| `BACK DECOMPOSE` | @.cursor/rules/back_developer/workflow-decompose.mdc |
| `BACK ANALYZE` | @.cursor/rules/back_developer/workflow-analyze.mdc |
| `BACK CREATIVE` | @.cursor/rules/back_developer/workflow-creative.mdc |
| `BACK IMPLEMENT` | @.cursor/rules/back_developer/workflow-implement.mdc |
| `BACK AUDIT` | @.cursor/rules/back_developer/workflow-audit.mdc |
| `BACK QA` | @.cursor/rules/back_developer/workflow-qa.mdc |
| `BACK ARCHIVE NOW` | @.cursor/rules/back_developer/workflow-archive.mdc |
| `BACK TASK` | @.cursor/rules/back_developer/workflow-task.mdc |
| `BACK BUGFIX` | @.cursor/rules/back_developer/workflow-bugfix.mdc |
| `BACK REFACTOR` | @.cursor/rules/back_developer/workflow-refactor.mdc |
| `BACK SECURITY` · `BACK SECURITY PLAN` · `BACK SECURITY DECOMPOSE` | @.cursor/rules/back_developer/workflow-security.mdc |

## Recovery / ad-hoc (не next после PLAN)

| Режим | Процесс |
|-------|---------|
| `BACK ROADMAP MERGE` | @.cursor/rules/back_developer/workflow-roadmap-merge.mdc — только если canon устарел без PLAN |
| `BACK RECONCILE` | @.cursor/rules/back_developer/workflow-reconcile.mdc — drift после hotfix |
| `BACK JANITOR` | @.cursor/rules/back_developer/workflow-janitor.mdc |

**Archive (не gate):** `workflow-reflect.mdc` — не линковать из hot path; lifecycle после QA = DONE.

Пути: @.cursor/rules/shared/memory-bank-paths.mdc (**только VAN** / структура).  
As-built: `memory-bank/architecture/` — @.cursor/rules/shared/workflow-van-brownfield.mdc.  
FINISH: @.cursor/rules/shared/finish-block.mdc  

